{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_8003_p", "source_sha256": "349fc5b4839474fde5aa58f19c48b81668d6887fe03aa0cda95f00e298804bac", "ja": "お疲れ様、美奈子。さっそく役に入り込んでるな。\nその調子でいい撮影にしていこう！", "zh": "辛苦了，美奈子。马上就进入角色了啊。就照这个状态，争取拍出一段精彩的作品吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_8004_019min", "source_sha256": "0d1063cd77f53524a1bc6e30b34ed1e483c06133935fe7b690780a0d9e9f7271", "ja": "はい！　でも、いつもの接客のクセが\n出ちゃう気がして……。どうしたらいいでしょう？", "zh": "好的！可是，我总觉得平时待客时的习惯会不小心表现出来……该怎么办才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_8005_p", "source_sha256": "5c344ee1e92aa9c22ccbd987ded2633f61d145238421940d0e003429a3c34ef7", "ja": "同じ接客業とはいえ、テイストが違うからな。\nそうだな……。", "zh": "虽说同样是接待客人，但风格不太一样呢。\n让我想想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_8006", "source_sha256": "c4d5e10b5ab3349ffb973d6bd65fad5d77195893f89218d19986bea49b0d9fe6", "ja": "大人っぽく！", "zh": "展现成熟的一面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_8007", "source_sha256": "e7fb603bae87cf23afd13405936ca2f56ad55feeb6f1382856d98bce9074f2c0", "ja": "いつものままで！", "zh": "像平时一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_8008", "source_sha256": "f17d5a1f5b2d8165176a1f3dcffdf277c2931de88ca9cfb91f289939395d2aec", "ja": "無言で！", "zh": "请保持沉默！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_8100_p", "source_sha256": "94278a05a098df0d9bda36f7f17f5532e1761749b925da5f3b9890181742a985", "ja": "少し大人っぽさを意識してみよう。\nチャキチャキではなく、しっとりと……だ。", "zh": "稍微注意表现出成熟感吧。\n不是风风火火的，而是要温婉娴静……一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_8101_019min", "source_sha256": "e423e634b67c3244f81c3ee389e1eec030650126fcbf2dd9fb70a7f2e0f063a8", "ja": "なるほど、しっとりですか……！\nせいろで蒸した中華まんみたいに、しっとりとですね！", "zh": "原来如此，要展现成熟感……！\n就像用蒸笼蒸出来的包子一样，湿润松软，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_8102_019min", "source_sha256": "2c1868727af7623f7e30eb06f191023aebe500e46ae3f5fecf793f492ae88f6f", "ja": "オホンッ。「いらっしゃいませ。本日のスペシャル\nカクテルはいかがですか？」……なんて。えへへ♪", "zh": "咳咳。“欢迎光临。要来一杯今天的特调鸡尾酒吗？”……之类的。诶嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_8200_p", "source_sha256": "704a7671c910abc763912e30cf3219912ac07f39a593a8d0bc722d82e62fe8e9", "ja": "バーテンダーも様々な人がいるからな。\n美奈子らしく、いつもの元気な感じで問題ないよ。", "zh": "调酒师也有各种各样的人嘛。保持美奈子一贯的活力就没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_8201_019min", "source_sha256": "fd4c5e6a70e3da9da879cafa21b45d392802175160e3d3850d6e840e0b09d2b7", "ja": "そうなんですね。バーテンダーって感情を表に出さない\nイメージがあったんで、ちょっと心配してたんです。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。我印象里的调酒师都是不把感情表露出来的人，所以还有点担心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_8202_019min", "source_sha256": "b81cead3a8660da389e5908eeb43010b3b84f6caa246c5421dda2d77de52e95b", "ja": "はぁ～、安心しました。いつも通りでいいなら、\n準備はバッチリです。明るく元気にお迎えしますね♪", "zh": "哈～，那我就放心了。既然和平时一样就好，准备已经万无一失了。我会开开心心、精神十足地迎接您的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_8300_p", "source_sha256": "dcd646bdd05800ba5da88f3731f73533ccfda4a38b42d683338d15af9ce30eaa", "ja": "美奈子は話すと元気さが溢れるからな。\n撮影中は無言を貫くのもいいかもしれない。", "zh": "美奈子一开口就会活力四射嘛。拍摄时或许一直保持沉默也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_8301_019min", "source_sha256": "781ef134d74048305199f0920e2127fe9f5a4351b73a103e9240f1c0d734c81e", "ja": "ええっ！？　それだと、カメラマンさんの指示も\n無視することになっちゃいますけど……。", "zh": "诶！？那样的话，不就连摄影师的指示也得无视了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_8302_019min", "source_sha256": "871a91570b8d0932238da7093b3e2020644fb17f88e6f2517f607e64af0f7d21", "ja": "{$P$}さん大丈夫ですか……？\nあまりにも感じが悪いのは、ちょっと……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，这样真的好吗……？\n要是显得态度太差，总觉得不太好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
